    {"id":"nh-evidence","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":250,"text":"# Terminal YouTube evidence\n\n10,000 broad-screen videos / 1,010 creators\n2,949 analysis-eligible\n7,677 observed transcripts / 2,323 gaps\n120 storyboard sets / 1,042 frames / 9,880 gaps\n\nBroad screen ≠ qualified competitor census.","color":"4"},
